{"slug":"kingdom","ad":"Kingdom","adEn":"Kingdom","yil":2012,"puan":74,"format":"TV","durum":"FINISHED","sezon":"SUMMER","sure":25,"poster":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/13/39511.jpg","banner":null,"ozet":"When low-born servant boys Piao and Xin set out to become the world’s greatest war generals, they quickly find themselves caught up in a violent struggle between two noblemen plotting to overthrow the King. After Piao is killed protecting the rightful ruler of the kingdom of Qin, Xin sets out on a campaign for revenge that leads him straight into the fire of war.\n\nNow, with a target on his back and an army of enemies standing in his way, it will be up to a boy with no name and a young king without a throne to return order to their war-torn country in this historical action-drama based on the Tezuka Award-winning manga, Kingdom.\n\n(Source: Funimation)\n\nNote: The first episode aired with a runtime of 50 minutes as opposed to the standard 25 minute runtime.","turler":["Aksiyon","Macera","Dram","Tarihi","Askeri","Dövüş Sanatları","Büyüme Hikâyesi","Erkek Başrol"],"iliski":[{"t":"SEQUEL","s":"kingdom-2nd-season","ad":"Kingdom Season 2","p":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx17389-KcR0AiBMuvzg.png","f":"TV"}],"seri":"kingdom","fragman":{"site":"youtube","id":"xXLf0iAXw_s"},"yasal":[{"a":"Hulu","u":"http://www.hulu.com/kingdom-2012"},{"a":"Crunchyroll","u":"https://www.crunchyroll.com/kingdom"},{"a":"YouTube","u":"https://www.youtube.com/@kingdom-anime/featured"}],"kaynakSayisi":174,"bolumSayisi":38,"bolumler":[{"n":1,"no":"1","ad":"1. Bölüm","slug":"kingdom-1-bolum","ks":7,"ekip":[{"g":"AniKeyf","e":null},{"g":"Peace","e":"Blackworms & thiefpliskin / Peace Fansub"},{"g":"RaionSubs-BD","e":"Çeviri: Karamak0 Encode: YerliOyuncu919 / www.raioncom.com"}],"src":[["MAIL","AniKeyf","https://videoapi.my.mail.ru/videos/embed/mail/feeling7d/_myvideo/699.html","ok"],["VK","AniKeyf","https://href.li/?https://vk.com/video_ext.php?oid=3